\title{kidvisionAccel: Opinionated Accelerometer Processing and Reporting for the KidVision Project}
\description{
Processes accelerometer data for participants in the KidVision project. It finds participants whose data have not yet been processed in REDCap, copies their raw GENEActiv files from the project's OneDrive folder, processes them with a pinned version of 'GGIR' using settings chosen for primary-school children, imports the results into REDCap, and creates a summary report for each participant.
